94:We speci /uniFB01 cally estimated the 50th (median), 5th, and 95th percentiles using an established approach [36]. Bootstrapping was used to estimate con /uniFB01 dence intervals for each percentile. Figure 1 shows estimated percentile curves for a representative cortical region and white matter tract, where con /uniFB01 dence intervals widen for age intervals comprising fewer individuals.

