78:**Supplementary Figure 6. Reproducibility of infra-normal deviations in cortical thickness between acquisition sites.** Cortical maps of infra-normal deviations were computed independently for each site **(a)** and the spatial correlation across cortical regions in the percentage of individuals with infra-normal deviations was evaluated using the Pearson correlation coefficient. Tables show the Pearson correlation coefficient between each pair of sites **(b)** and the corresponding two-sided p-value **(c)** . Statistically significant correlations (p&lt;0.05) are shown in red.
